--- !u!114 &1151078605445753
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1669850892241962}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 396459964a4a45a4b7cef4c9082df875, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPC
  displayName: "Monsieur Andre"
  title: "The other new manager"
  tint: {r: 0.35, g: 0.5, b: 0.3, a: 1}
  lines:
  - text: "It's harmless enough, What is it they really want? A box for to-night?"
  - text: "By the way, they seem to be greatly interested in that little Christine Daae!"
  - text: "Well, but what were those people laughing at?"
  - text: "Was there any one in the box on the right of Box Five?"
  - text: "And he takes his vermouth at Tortoni's with Lagrene, Scholl and Pertuiset, the lion-hunter, We shall have the whole press against us!"
  - text: "It's not a bad house, for 'a house with a curse on it.'"
  - text: "By the way, you know that Mother Giry is going to lodge a complaint against you."
  - text: "She's not the only idiot in this business,"
  - text: "Oh, wonderful, no doubt! Only, you forget, Richard, that I provided ten-thousand francs of the twenty and that nobody put anything in my pocket!"
  - text: "I should hope not, indeed!"
  - text: "And what might you think?"
  - text: "On my soul, on my soul, I swear that I haven't got it!"
